#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:329
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid "Recruit him - "
msgstr "그를 영입한다 - 식량 "

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:329
#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:373
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid " food"
msgstr "<EMPTY>"

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:338
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid ""
" buys the cannon! It's the type that you'd find on an old ship. \r\n"
"\tShe throws in an enormous pile of cannonballs and gunpowder. It somehow fits in a little space in the trunk.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 대포를 산다! 옛날 배에서나 볼 법한 종류다. \r\n"
"\t그녀는 엄청난 양의 포탄과 화약까지 얹어 준다. 어째선지 트렁크의 작은 틈에 다 들어간다.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:340
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid "Yarp."
msgstr "그래."

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:349
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid "Yarrrrrr!"
msgstr "야르르르르르!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:349
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid " She sounds enthusiastic."
msgstr " 신나 보인다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:352
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid ""
" needs extra room for the cannonballs she's bringing. Who leaves the group?"
msgstr "은(는) 가져올 포탄 때문에 자리가 더 필요하다. 누가 일행을 떠날까?"

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:359
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid "Terror of the Zombie Sea"
msgstr "좀비 바다의 공포"

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:361
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid ""
"This woman is a pirate. At least that's what you assume, due to the peg leg, eyepatch, cutlass, clothing, and hat.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"이 여자는 해적이다. 적어도 의족, 안대, 커틀러스, 옷차림, 모자를 보면 그런 것 같다.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:362
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid "Yarr!"
msgstr "야르!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:364
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid "This checks out. She offers to sell "
msgstr "그럴 만하다. 그녀는 "

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:364
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid " a cannon for 5 food, or join "
msgstr "에게 대포를 식량 5에 팔거나, 식량 20을 받고 "

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:366
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid " already bought a cannon, so she reduced the price of recruiting her."
msgstr "은(는) 이미 대포를 샀으니, 그녀는 영입 비용을 낮춰 준다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:370
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid "Buy Cannon - 5 food"
msgstr "대포 구매 - 식량 5"

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:373
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid "Recruit her - "
msgstr "그녀를 영입한다 - 식량 "

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:386
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid " and her companion both join the team! Two for the price of one!"
msgstr "와(과) 동료가 둘 다 팀에 합류한다! 하나 값에 둘!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:391
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid "Wood Woman"
msgstr "통나무 여인"

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:393
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid ""
" meets a mysterious woman. She holds a massive chunk of wood in her arms.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 수수께끼의 여자를 만난다. 거대한 나무 토막을 품에 안고 있다.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:394
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid ""
"My log says you can be trusted. I am more pragmatic. Pay me and I'll join "
"you."
msgstr "내 통나무가 너흰 믿어도 된대. 난 좀 더 현실적이야. 돈을 내면 합류하지."

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:397
#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:507
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid "Recruit her - 10 food"
msgstr "그녀를 영입한다 - 식량 10"

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:412
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid "Try Burning Everything"
msgstr "전부 태워 보기"

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:414
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid ""
"This person is covered head to toe in fireproof gear.\r\n"
"\tThis would usually be more suspicious, but you're used to this sort of thing.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"이 사람은 머리부터 발끝까지 방화복으로 감싸고 있다.\r\n"
"\t평소라면 더 수상했겠지만, 이런 건 이제 익숙하다.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:416
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid "Hi. Did you know that zombies are highly flammable?"
msgstr "안녕. 좀비가 엄청 잘 탄다는 거 알아?"

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:418
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid "Leave for now"
msgstr "일단 둔다"

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:419
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid "Recruit for 15 food"
msgstr "식량 15에 영입한다"

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:421
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid "You need 15 food to properly make friends."
msgstr "제대로 친구가 되려면 식량 15가 필요하다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:430
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid "PLINK PLINK PLINK PLINK PLINK"
msgstr "핑 핑 핑 핑 핑"

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:434
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid "Is This Cosplay?"
msgstr "이거 코스프레야?"

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:436
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid ""
"This person is covered in blue tights, a weird helmet, and is wearing a big plastic tube on one of his arms.\r\n"
"\tThis would usually be more suspicious, but you're used to this sort of thing.\r\n"
"\tHe strikes a dynamic pose with his plastic tube arm."
msgstr ""
"이 사람은 파란 쫄쫄이에 이상한 헬멧을 쓰고, 한쪽 팔에 커다란 플라스틱 통을 끼고 있다.\r\n"
"\t평소라면 더 수상했겠지만, 이런 건 이제 익숙하다.\r\n"
"\t그는 플라스틱 통 팔로 역동적인 포즈를 취한다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:441
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid "Recruit him - 20 food"
msgstr "그를 영입한다 - 식량 20"

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:443
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid "You need 20 food to recruit him to the party."
msgstr "그를 일행으로 영입하려면 식량 20이 필요하다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:450
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid "Bee strong, bee loyal."
msgstr "벌처럼 강하게, 벌처럼 충직하게."

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:454
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid "Bee Power"
msgstr "벌 파워"

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:456
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid ""
"It's Bee Mann! He was a popular children's show host, when TV still existed.\r\n"
"\tBy some miracle, he's still around."
msgstr ""
"비 맨이다! TV가 아직 있던 시절, 인기 어린이 프로그램 진행자였다.\r\n"
"\t기적적으로 아직 살아 있다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:458
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid "It's a little strange that he's still wearing his costume."
msgstr "아직도 의상을 입고 있다는 건 좀 이상하다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:461
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid "Recruit him - 5 food"
msgstr "그를 영입한다 - 식량 5"

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:463
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid "You need 5 food to recruit him to the party."
msgstr "그를 일행으로 영입하려면 식량 5가 필요하다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:477
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid "Tiny Animal"
msgstr "작은 동물"

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:479
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid ""
"It's a small animal.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"작은 동물이다.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:480
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid ""
" looks like some kind of rodent? \r\n"
"\tI'm not an expert on what is and isn't a rodent."
msgstr ""
"는 무슨 설치류처럼 보인다? \r\n"
"\t뭐가 설치류고 아닌지 나는 잘 모른다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:484
#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:767
#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:787
#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:981
#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:1040
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid "Recruit "
msgstr "영입: "

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:484
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid " - 3 food"
msgstr " - 식량 3"

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:486
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid "You need 3 food to recruit "
msgstr "식량 3이 있어야 "

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:486
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid " to the party."
msgstr "를 일행으로 영입할 수 있다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:495
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid "Let's blast our way to Canada! Two shells at a time!"
msgstr "캐나다까지 쏴서 뚫고 가자! 두 발씩!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:500
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid "Super Shotgun"
msgstr "슈퍼 산탄총"

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:502
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid ""
"This woman is cleaning a double barrel shotgun. On closer inspection, her "
"weapon seems sturdier than normal. It is covered in fine engraving."
msgstr "이 여자는 쌍발 산탄총을 닦고 있다. 자세히 보니 보통 총보다 튼튼해 보인다. 정교한 조각이 새겨져 있다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:503
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid ""
"Have shotgun, will travel.\r\n"
"\tRecruit me and I'll show you how many zombies I can splat in one shot!"
msgstr ""
"산탄총만 있으면 어디든 간다.\r\n"
"\t날 영입하면 한 방에 좀비를 몇 마리나 터뜨리는지 보여 주지!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:509
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid "You need 10 food to recruit her to the party."
msgstr "그녀를 일행으로 영입하려면 식량 10이 필요하다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:518
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid "What weapon should I get out first?"
msgstr "어떤 무기부터 꺼낼까?"

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:523
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid "Truly Barbaric"
msgstr "진정한 야만"

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:525
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid ""
"She is wearing primitive leather armor, and her hair is stuffed into a very "
"old looking metal helmet. Is this the next fashion trend in the "
"zombocalypse?"
msgstr "그녀는 원시적인 가죽 갑옷을 입고, 아주 오래돼 보이는 쇠 투구에 머리를 쑤셔 넣었다. 이게 좀비 종말의 다음 유행인가?"

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:526
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid ""
"I own 18 different weapons, each one is my favorite.\r\n"
"\tI like to switch between them so I don't get bored!"
msgstr ""
"난 무기가 18개 있는데, 하나하나가 다 최애야.\r\n"
"\t지루하지 않게 번갈아 쓰는 걸 좋아해!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:530
#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:640
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid "Recruit her - 15 food"
msgstr "그녀를 영입한다 - 식량 15"

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:532
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid "You need 15 food to recruit her to the party."
msgstr "그녀를 일행으로 영입하려면 식량 15가 필요하다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:541
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid "I brought my own weapons!"
msgstr "내 무기는 내가 챙겨 왔어!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:546
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid "MooD"
msgstr "MooD"

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:548
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid ""
"This man is wearing futuristic sci-fi armor and holding a matching rifle. "
"Likely some kind of cosplay, though I don't know who because I'm not a nerd."
msgstr ""
"이 남자는 미래적인 SF 갑옷을 입고 거기 어울리는 소총을 들고 있다. 아마 무슨 코스프레겠지만, 누군지는 모르겠다. 난 덕후가 "
"아니니까."

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:549
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid ""
"Nobody tells Moody what to do!\r\n"
"\tI'm Moody."
msgstr ""
"누구도 무디에게 명령할 수 없다!\r\n"
"\t내가 무디다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:553
#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:579
#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:687
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid "Recruit him - 15 food"
msgstr "그를 영입한다 - 식량 15"

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:555
#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:581
#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:605
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid "You need 15 food to recruit him to the party."
msgstr "그를 일행으로 영입하려면 식량 15가 필요하다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:565
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid "[STAND NAME] S DOGGY DOGG   [STAND MASTER] CharBro"
msgstr "[스탠드 이름] S 도기 독   [스탠드 마스터] CharBro"

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:566
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid ""
"DESTRUCTIVE POWER: B   SPEED: B   RANGE: C\r\n"
"\tDURABILITY: C   PRECISION: C   POTENTIAL: C"
msgstr ""
"파괴력: B   스피드: B   사정거리: C\r\n"
"\t지속력: C   정밀동작성: C   성장성: C"

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:572
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid "Finally, a CharBro Reference"
msgstr "드디어, CharBro 패러디"

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:574
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid "This extremely buff man claims to be a 'Stamp User', though "
msgstr "이 엄청나게 우람한 남자는 자기가 '스탠드 사용자'라고 주장하지만, "

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:574
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid " has no idea what this means and does not care to know."
msgstr "은(는) 그게 무슨 뜻인지 모르고 알고 싶지도 않다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:575
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid "Yare yare daze...."
msgstr "야레야레다제...."

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:576
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid ""
"TRANSLATORS NOTE: LOOSELY TRANSLATED FROM JAPANESE, THIS MEANS 'GOOD GRIEF.'"
msgstr "번역자 주: 일본어를 대충 번역하면 '아이고 맙소사'라는 뜻이다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:591
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid " offers him a new job: Zombie crushing."
msgstr "은(는) 그에게 새 일자리를 제안한다: 좀비 분쇄."

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:592
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid "Break over!"
msgstr "휴식 끝!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:597
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid "Under Construction"
msgstr "공사 중"

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:599
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid ""
"This man is dressed up like a construction worker, but what's being built? "
"It seems like he's just standing around. Maybe he's been standing around for"
" years."
msgstr ""
"이 남자는 공사장 인부처럼 차려입었는데, 대체 뭘 짓고 있는 걸까? 그냥 서 있기만 하는 것 같다. 몇 년째 서 있었을지도 모른다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:600
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid "I'm on break!"
msgstr "나 쉬는 시간이야!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:603
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid "Hire him - 15 food"
msgstr "그를 고용한다 - 식량 15"

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:616
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid " buys a map! This will help for a sense of direction."
msgstr "은(는) 지도를 산다! 방향 감각에 도움이 될 거다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:622
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid "My maps will get us straight to Canada!"
msgstr "내 지도면 캐나다까지 곧장 갈 수 있어!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:627
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid "I like Maps"
msgstr "지도가 좋아"

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:629
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid ""
"This woman is carrying a bunch of maps. You can see a bunch of papers sticking out of her backpack.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"이 여자는 지도를 잔뜩 들고 있다. 배낭 밖으로 종이 뭉치가 삐져나와 있다.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:630
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid ""
"I love maps! Started makin' them ever since before the apocalypse, now they've been more useful than ever!\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"난 지도가 좋아! 종말 전부터 만들기 시작했는데, 지금은 그 어느 때보다 쓸모가 많다니까!\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:631
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid "She offers to sell "
msgstr "그녀는 "

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:631
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid " one of her maps, or to join for some food."
msgstr "에게 지도 한 장을 팔거나, 식량을 받고 합류하겠다고 한다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:635
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid "Buy a Map - 5 food"
msgstr "지도 구매 - 식량 5"

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:637
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid ""
" already bought a map from her. She doesn't seem to want to give out any "
"more maps."
msgstr "은(는) 이미 그녀에게 지도를 샀다. 지도를 더 내줄 생각은 없어 보인다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:642
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid " doesn't have enough food to recruit her, unfortunately."
msgstr "은(는) 아쉽게도 그녀를 영입할 식량이 부족하다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:645
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid " doesn't have enough food to buy anything!"
msgstr "은(는) 뭘 살 식량이 부족하다!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:655
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid "Champion in Training"
msgstr "수련 중인 챔피언"

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:657
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid ""
"Alright! Let's go!\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"좋아! 가자!\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:658
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid "He eats the food in no time at all."
msgstr "그는 식량을 순식간에 먹어 치운다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:665
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid " buys "
msgstr "은(는) 남자에게서 "

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:665
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid "some"
msgstr "퓨키볼 여러 개"

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:665
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid "one"
msgstr "퓨키볼 한 개"

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:665
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid " Pukeyball"
msgstr "<EMPTY>"

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:665
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid "s"
msgstr "<EMPTY>"

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:665
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid ""
" from the man.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"를 산다.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:666
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid "They'll fare you well!"
msgstr "잘 해낼 거야!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:679
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid "Catch 'em All"
msgstr "전부 잡아라"

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:681
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid ""
" finds a man with a frying pan in the camp. He's being followed by a floating rock with arms?\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 캠프에서 프라이팬을 든 남자를 발견한다. 팔 달린 떠다니는 바위가 그를 따라다닌다?\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:682
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid ""
"All these zombies chased the Pukeymon all away, but I won't give up hope! I'll keep training and be the best there ever was!\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"좀비들 때문에 퓨키몬이 전부 도망가 버렸지만, 난 희망을 버리지 않아! 계속 수련해서 역대 최고가 될 거야!\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:683
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid ""
"What in the world is he babbling about?\r\n"
"\tAside from that, he offers to sell "
msgstr ""
"대체 무슨 소리를 하는 거지?\r\n"
"\t그건 그렇고, 그는 "

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:684
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid " some Pukeyballs, 2 food for 1 ball, or to join for 15 food."
msgstr "에게 퓨키볼을 1개당 식량 2에 팔거나, 식량 15에 합류하겠다고 한다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:685
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid "Leave him be"
msgstr "내버려 둔다"

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:689
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid " doesn't have enough food to recruit him."
msgstr "은(는) 그를 영입할 식량이 부족하다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:691
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid "He's out of pukeyballs to sell you!"
msgstr "그는 팔 퓨키볼이 다 떨어졌다!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:692
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid " has no food to buy any Pukeyballs with!"
msgstr "은(는) 퓨키볼을 살 식량이 없다!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:695
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid "Buy full Pukeymon team - 12 food"
msgstr "퓨키몬 풀팀 구매 - 식량 12"

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:699
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid "Buy 3 Pukeyballs - 6 food"
msgstr "퓨키볼 3개 구매 - 식량 6"

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:703
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid "Buy a Pukeyball - 2 food"
msgstr "퓨키볼 구매 - 식량 2"

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:739
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid " is glad to be back!"
msgstr "은(는) 돌아와서 기쁘다!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:742
#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:756
#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:776
#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:964
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid ""
"The group is full.\r\n"
"\t\tWho would you like to replace to make room for "
msgstr ""
"일행이 꽉 찼다.\r\n"
"\t\t누구를 빼고 자리를 만들까: "

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:752
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid " devours the food!"
msgstr "은(는) 식량을 게걸스럽게 먹어 치운다!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:767
#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:981
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid " - 5 food"
msgstr " - 식량 5"

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:772
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid ""
" devours the food! It's like watching a speed eating competition, but with "
"one person."
msgstr "은(는) 식량을 게걸스럽게 먹어 치운다! 1인 빨리 먹기 대회를 보는 것 같다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:787
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid " - 10 food"
msgstr " - 식량 10"

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:795
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid " is tired of being stuck in this camp. "
msgstr "은(는) 이 캠프에 갇혀 있는 데 질렸다. "

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:795
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid " will join you, for a small fee of 5 food!"
msgstr "는 식량 5라는 소소한 값에 합류하겠다고 한다!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:799
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid "You don't have enough food to spare."
msgstr "내줄 식량이 부족하다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:806
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid "The Outdoors Fitness Lifestyle"
msgstr "아웃도어 피트니스 라이프스타일"

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:812
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid " claims to be physically fit. "
msgstr "은(는) 체력이 좋다고 주장한다. "

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:837
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid "Muscle Mercenary"
msgstr "근육 용병"

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:843
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid " claims to be really strong. "
msgstr "은(는) 힘이 정말 세다고 주장한다. "

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:868
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid "Hired Gun"
msgstr "청부 총잡이"

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:874
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid " claims to be a great shot with a gun. "
msgstr "은(는) 총을 정말 잘 쏜다고 주장한다. "

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:899
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid "Field Medic"
msgstr "야전 의무병"

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:905
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid " claims to be experienced in medical matters. "
msgstr "은(는) 의료 경험이 많다고 주장한다. "

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:930
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid "Mechanic for Hire"
msgstr "출장 정비사"

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:936
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid " claims to be great at fixing cars and machinery. "
msgstr "은(는) 차와 기계를 잘 고친다고 주장한다. "

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:961
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid " is tamed using DOG PSYCHOLOGY by "
msgstr "은(는) 개 심리학에 넘어가 길들여진다. 길들인 사람은 "

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:961
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid ", who insists on bringing "
msgstr "! 그 사람은 "

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:961
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid " along!"
msgstr "를 꼭 데려가겠다고 고집한다!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:973
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid "A Dog With No Cause"
msgstr "이유 없는 개"

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:977
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid " is hanging around the camp, tame but with no one to follow. "
msgstr "은(는) 캠프 주변을 어슬렁거린다. 길들여졌지만 따를 주인이 없다. "

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:977
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid " must have been abandoned here."
msgstr "는 여기 버려진 게 분명하다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:979
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid "Leave the dog alone"
msgstr "개를 내버려 둔다"

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:984
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid " recruits the dog!"
msgstr "이(가) 개를 영입한다!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:989
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid "If At First You Don't Succeed"
msgstr "처음엔 실패하더라도"

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:991
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid " almost made it to Canada. "
msgstr "은(는) 캐나다에 거의 다 갔었다. "

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:991
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid " got as far as the City of Crushed Hopes, where the rest of "
msgstr "는 무너진 희망의 도시까지 갔는데, 거기서 "

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:991
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid ""
" group was eaten.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
" 일행은 잡아먹혔다.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:992
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid " offers to join you for 10 food. "
msgstr "는 식량 10에 합류하겠다고 한다. "

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:992
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid " has a real good feeling about this attempt!"
msgstr "는 이번 도전에 정말 좋은 예감이 든다!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:1000
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid " gives a quick demonstration of "
msgstr "이(가) 재빨리 시범을 보인다:"

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:1002
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid "shooting skills!"
msgstr "사격 실력!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:1007
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid "mighty strength!"
msgstr "엄청난 힘!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:1011
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid "physical fitness!"
msgstr "체력!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:1017
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid ""
"My last team was a bunch of wieners! I think I'll do a lot better this time "
"around, if you give me a chance!"
msgstr "지난 팀은 죄다 찌질이였어! 기회만 준다면 이번엔 훨씬 잘할 수 있을 거야!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:1025
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid "Familiar Face"
msgstr "낯익은 얼굴"

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:1029
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid " is hanging around the camp. "
msgstr "은(는) 캠프 주변을 어슬렁거리고 있다. "

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:1029
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid " has been waiting for you to show up!"
msgstr "는 너희가 나타나길 기다리고 있었다!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:1032
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid ""
" claims to know you, but you swear you've never seen this person before..."
msgstr "는 너희를 안다고 주장하지만, 이 사람은 맹세코 처음 본다..."

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:1034
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid "TRAIT: "
msgstr "특성: "

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:1035
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid "  PERK: "
msgstr "  특전: "

#: deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df:5
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df"
msgid ""
"YOU GOT LIKE A BILLION PEOPLE.\r\n"
"\tGO AWAY.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"사람이 무슨 10억 명은 있네.\r\n"
"\t꺼져.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df:7
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df"
msgid "You'll have to clear a spot if you want this annoying person."
msgstr "이 짜증 나는 사람을 원한다면 자리를 비워야 한다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df:10
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df"
msgid ""
"FINE, whatever! \r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"그래, 알았다고! \r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df:11
#: deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df:33
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df"
msgid "The door opens and "
msgstr "문이 열리고 "

#: deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df:11
#: deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df:33
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df"
msgid " comes out."
msgstr "이(가) 나온다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df:15
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df"
msgid ""
"YOU ARE AN ESPECIALLY HUGE DINK. \r\n"
"\tYOU DINK.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"너 진짜 엄청난 찐따구나. \r\n"
"\t이 찐따야.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df:17
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df"
msgid " is infuriated and smashes on the door for awhile. "
msgstr "은(는) 화가 치밀어 한동안 문을 두들긴다. "

#: deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df:17
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df"
msgid " ends up leaving shortly after."
msgstr "은(는) 곧 자리를 뜬다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df:21
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df"
msgid " farts on the locked door."
msgstr "은(는) 잠긴 문에 방귀를 뀐다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df:23
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df"
msgid " tells the voice to "
msgstr "은(는) 목소리에게 말한다: "

#: deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df:23
#: deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df:91
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df"
msgid "COOL IT."
msgstr "진정해."

#: deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df:26
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df"
msgid "HHHHHHEH! YOU'RE ALRIGHT! "
msgstr "흐흐흐흐흐헤! 너 괜찮은 놈이구나! "

#: deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df:28
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df"
msgid ""
"YOU HAVE TOO MANY PEOPLE, THOUGH.\r\n"
"\t\t\t"
msgstr ""
"근데 사람이 너무 많아.\r\n"
"\t\t\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df:29
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df"
msgid "The door stays shut unless you get rid of someone."
msgstr "누군가를 내보내지 않으면 문은 열리지 않는다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df:32
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df"
msgid ""
"OK, I'M IN!\r\n"
"\t\t\t"
msgstr ""
"좋아, 나도 낄게!\r\n"
"\t\t\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df:37
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df"
msgid ""
"SAY IT, DON'T SPRAY IT! \r\n"
"\t\tI HATE ANNOYING PEOPLE!\r\n"
"\t\t"
msgstr ""
"말로 해, 침 튀기지 말고! \r\n"
"\t\t짜증 나는 놈들 딱 질색이야!\r\n"
"\t\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df:39
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df"
msgid "The voice refuses to open the door, and "
msgstr "목소리는 문을 열어 주지 않고, "

#: deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df:39
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df"
msgid " ends up leaving."
msgstr "은(는) 결국 떠난다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df:44
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df"
msgid "The Dinkdoor: Door of Dinks"
msgstr "찐따문: 찐따들의 문"

#: deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df:50
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df"
msgid ""
" comes across a house by the road. It's locked.\r\n"
"\tWhile trying to smash the door down, a voice calls out:\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 길가에서 집 한 채를 발견한다. 잠겨 있다.\r\n"
"\t문을 부수려는데, 목소리가 들린다:\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df:52
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df"
msgid "HEY LEAVE MY DOOR ALONE YOU DINKS"
msgstr "야 내 문 건드리지 마 이 찐따들아"

#: deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df:53
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df"
msgid "Try to Recruit"
msgstr "영입을 시도한다"

#: deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df:54
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df"
msgid ": I'M NOT A DINK"
msgstr ": 난 찐따 아니야"

#: deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df:56
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df"
msgid " tells voice to COOL IT"
msgstr "이(가) 목소리에게 진정하라고 한다"

#: deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df:63
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df"
msgid " says that there are too many people in your car already, and that "
msgstr "은(는) 너희 차에 이미 사람이 너무 많다며, "

#: deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df:63
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df"
msgid ""
"'ll be fine staying put for awhile longer.\r\n"
"\t\tDitch someone to make room:"
msgstr ""
"는 한동안 여기 있어도 괜찮다고 한다.\r\n"
"\t\t자리를 만들려면 누군가를 내보내라:"

#: deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df:67
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df"
msgid ""
"Sure, I'll join! I was running out of food, anyway.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"좋아, 합류할게! 어차피 식량도 떨어져 가던 참이야.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df:68
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df"
msgid ""
" is now part of the team!\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 이제 팀의 일원이다!\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df:69
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df"
msgid ""
" brings along some food supplies! Bonus!\r\n"
"\tOnward to Canada!"
msgstr ""
"이(가) 식량을 좀 가져온다! 보너스!\r\n"
"\t캐나다로 전진!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df:78
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df"
msgid " robs "
msgstr "은(는) "

#: deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df:78
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df"
msgid ""
".\r\n"
"\tThis is probably why your group has just one person in it."
msgstr "을(를) 털어 버린다.\r\n\t아마 이래서 너희 일행이 한 명뿐인 거다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df:81
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df"
msgid " convinces the group to rob "
msgstr "은(는) 일행을 설득한다. 털 대상은 "

#: deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df:89
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df"
msgid " farts. It echoes in the grocery store."
msgstr "이(가) 방귀를 뀐다. 식료품점에 메아리친다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df:91
#: deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df:127
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df"
msgid " tells "
msgstr "은(는) "

#: deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df:91
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df"
msgid " to "
msgstr "에게 말한다: "

#: deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df:94
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df"
msgid " is impressed by this devil-may-care attitude!"
msgstr "는 이 거침없는 태도에 감명받는다!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df:96
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df"
msgid ""
"Here, take a bunch of food I had stored up!\r\n"
"\t\t\t"
msgstr ""
"자, 내가 쟁여 둔 식량 잔뜩 가져가!\r\n"
"\t\t\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df:97
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df"
msgid "The team goes on their way with the food."
msgstr "팀은 식량을 챙겨 갈 길을 간다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df:99
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df"
msgid "Let me come with you! I have a bunch of food!"
msgstr "나도 같이 가자! 식량 많이 있어!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df:104
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df"
msgid ""
" is mostly just confused by this.\r\n"
"\t\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 그저 어리둥절할 뿐이다.\r\n"
"\t\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df:105
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df"
msgid ""
"What? I wasn't doing anything...\r\n"
"\t\t"
msgstr ""
"뭐? 난 아무것도 안 했는데...\r\n"
"\t\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df:106
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df"
msgid " Wow! What a nerd! "
msgstr " 와! 완전 찐따네! "

#: deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df:106
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df"
msgid " leaves "
msgstr "은(는) 그냥 떠난다. 남겨진 "

#: deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df:111
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df"
msgid "Grocery Squatter"
msgstr "식료품점 무단 거주자"

#: deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df:119
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df"
msgid ""
" is about to break into a small, fortified grocery store, but then finds "
msgstr "은(는) 작고 튼튼하게 막아 둔 식료품점에 막 침입하려는데, "

#: deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df:119
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df"
msgid ""
" already living inside!\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"이(가) 이미 안에 살고 있다!\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df:120
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df"
msgid " seems like a calm, clever person."
msgstr "는 차분하고 영리한 사람 같다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df:121
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df"
msgid "Ask "
msgstr "<EMPTY>"

#: deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df:121
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df"
msgid " to join"
msgstr "에게 합류를 요청한다"

#: deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df:122
#: deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df:365
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df"
msgid "Leave "
msgstr "일단 "

#: deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df:122
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df"
msgid " alone"
msgstr "을(를) 두고 간다"

#: deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df:124
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df"
msgid ": Let's rob this dingus!"
msgstr ": 이 멍청이를 털자!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df:127
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df"
msgid " to COOL IT"
msgstr "에게 진정하라고 한다"

#: deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df:132
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df"
msgid "Kinda Pushy"
msgstr "좀 막무가내"

#: deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df:140
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df"
msgid " finds another traveller by the roadside, named "
msgstr "은(는) 길가에서 다른 여행자를 발견한다. 이름은 "

#: deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df:141
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df"
msgid " insists on joining the group, immediately. "
msgstr "는 당장 일행에 합류하겠다고 우긴다. "

#: deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df:143
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df"
msgid " considers the benefits of "
msgstr "은(는) 지금까지의 "

#: deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df:143
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df"
msgid " LONE WOLF strategy so far. Should "
msgstr " 외톨이 늑대 전략의 이점을 따져 본다. "

#: deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df:143
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df"
msgid " recruit "
msgstr "모두 영입해야 할까: "

#: deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df:147
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df"
msgid ""
" isn't even given a choice.\r\n"
"\t\t"
msgstr ""
"에게는 선택권조차 주어지지 않는다.\r\n"
"\t\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df:148
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df"
msgid " joins the party! Onward to Canada?"
msgstr "이(가) 일행에 합류한다! 캐나다로 전진?"

#: deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df:153
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df"
msgid ""
"The car is already full! Someone will have to be kicked out of the group to "
"make room:"
msgstr "차가 이미 꽉 찼다! 자리를 만들려면 누군가를 일행에서 쫓아내야 한다:"

#: deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df:161
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df"
msgid " finds a new person, "
msgstr "은(는) 새로운 사람을 발견한다: "

#: deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df:162
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df"
msgid " is alone, and wants to join the team!"
msgstr "는 혼자이고, 팀에 합류하고 싶어 한다!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df:169
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df"
msgid " vouches for this claim."
msgstr "은(는) 이 말이 사실이라고 보증한다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df:170
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df"
msgid " trusts this based on "
msgstr "은(는) 이 말을 믿는다. 근거는 "

#: deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df:170
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df"
msgid " experience."
msgstr " 경험이다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df:171
#: deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df:184
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df"
msgid " thinks that "
msgstr "은(는) "

#: deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df:171
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df"
msgid " is telling the truth."
msgstr "가 진실을 말한다고 생각한다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df:172
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df"
msgid " has a good feeling about this person."
msgstr "은(는) 이 사람에게서 좋은 느낌을 받는다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df:173
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df"
msgid " has a gut feeling that this is the truth."
msgstr "은(는) 이게 사실이라는 직감이 든다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df:182
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df"
msgid " seriously doubts this."
msgstr "은(는) 이 말을 심각하게 의심한다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df:183
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df"
msgid " rolls "
msgstr "은(는) "

#: deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df:183
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df"
msgid " eyes at this obvious lie."
msgstr " 뻔한 거짓말에 눈을 굴린다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df:184
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df"
msgid " is lying."
msgstr "가 거짓말을 한다고 생각한다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df:185
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df"
msgid " has a very bad feeling about this person."
msgstr "은(는) 이 사람에게서 아주 나쁜 느낌을 받는다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df:186
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df"
msgid " has a gut feeling that this is a lie."
msgstr "은(는) 이게 거짓말이라는 직감이 든다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df:187
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df"
msgid " knows that something is off about "
msgstr "은(는) 직감한다. 수상한 사람은 바로 "

#: deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df:194
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df"
msgid " flexes in a dramatic way to prove it."
msgstr "는 증명하겠다며 과장되게 근육을 뽐낸다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df:195
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df"
msgid " talks about a past life as a lumberjack."
msgstr "는 전생에 나무꾼이었다고 이야기한다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df:196
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df"
msgid " talks about a former life as a bodybuilder."
msgstr "는 예전에 보디빌더였다고 이야기한다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df:197
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df"
msgid " boasts about being a former 'caged pit deathmatch' fighter."
msgstr "는 왕년에 '철창 데스매치' 파이터였다고 자랑한다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df:198
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df"
msgid " bends a spoon, very aggressively."
msgstr "는 숟가락을 아주 공격적으로 구부린다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df:199
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df"
msgid " flexes and grunts HARD, beads of sweat forming on forehead."
msgstr "는 이마에 땀방울이 맺힐 만큼 세게 근육에 힘을 주며 끙끙댄다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df:205
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df"
msgid " reveals that "
msgstr "는 밝힌다. "

#: deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df:205
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df"
msgid " was a track star in college."
msgstr "는 대학 시절 육상 스타였다고."

#: deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df:206
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df"
msgid " does a clumsy half-cartwheel. Maybe it's an off day for "
msgstr "는 어설프게 반쯤 옆돌기를 한다. 오늘 컨디션이 안 좋은 날인가, "

#: deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df:207
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df"
msgid " shows off an elaborate stretching routine to prove it."
msgstr "는 증명하겠다며 정교한 스트레칭 루틴을 선보인다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df:208
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df"
msgid ""
" jogs in place for a bit. It looks ok? There's little to no wheezing..."
msgstr "는 잠깐 제자리 뛰기를 한다. 괜찮아 보인다? 헐떡임이 거의 없다..."

#: deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df:209
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df"
msgid " does a quick little dance. Then "
msgstr "는 짧게 춤을 춘다. 그러더니 "

#: deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df:209
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df"
msgid " stops, saying to recruit "
msgstr "은(는) 멈추고, 더 보고 싶으면 "

#: deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df:209
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df"
msgid " for more."
msgstr "를 영입하라고 한다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df:210
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df"
msgid " boasts about how "
msgstr "는 자랑한다. "

#: deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df:210
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df"
msgid " used to be an olympic athlete."
msgstr "는 올림픽 선수였다고."

#: deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df:216
#: deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df:230
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df"
msgid " talks about "
msgstr "는 이야기한다: "

#: deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df:216
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df"
msgid " favorite guns, though it's worrying that "
msgstr " 최애 총들에 대해. 그런데 걱정스럽게도 "

#: deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df:216
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df"
msgid " pronounces 'guns' wrong."
msgstr "는 '총'을 잘못 발음한다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df:217
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df"
msgid ""
" talks about a past life as a police officer. 'Not just any cop, a "
"supercop'."
msgstr "는 예전에 경찰이었다고 이야기한다. '그냥 경찰이 아니라, 슈퍼 경찰'."

#: deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df:218
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df"
msgid " talks about all "
msgstr "는 늘어놓는다: "

#: deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df:218
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df"
msgid " shooting trophies and trophies for best guns."
msgstr " 사격 트로피와 최고의 총 트로피 전부를."

#: deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df:219
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df"
msgid " refuses to prove "
msgstr "는 증명하길 거부한다: "

#: deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df:219
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df"
msgid "'s a good shot because "
msgstr "가 명사수라는 걸. 이유는 "

#: deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df:219
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df"
msgid " finger hurts right now. Suspicious."
msgstr " 손가락이 지금 아파서란다. 수상하다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df:220
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df"
msgid " twirls a pistol around, before accidentally dropping and breaking it."
msgstr "는 권총을 빙글빙글 돌리다 실수로 떨어뜨려 망가뜨린다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df:221
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df"
msgid " shoots a rubber band off "
msgstr "는 고무줄을 쏜다. "

#: deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df:221
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df"
msgid " finger to show off "
msgstr " 손가락에서, 자랑하려고 "

#: deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df:221
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df"
msgid " aim, but misses."
msgstr " 조준 실력을. 하지만 빗나간다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df:227
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df"
msgid " spouts a bunch of medicalish jargon. Seems plausible?"
msgstr "는 의학 비슷한 전문용어를 잔뜩 늘어놓는다. 그럴듯한가?"

#: deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df:228
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df"
msgid " is evasive when asked what "
msgstr "는 얼버무린다. "

#: deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df:228
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df"
msgid " practice was."
msgstr " 전공 분야를 묻자."

#: deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df:229
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df"
msgid " nearly admits that "
msgstr "는 털어놓을 뻔한다. "

#: deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df:229
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df"
msgid " wasn't a 'doctor-doctor', but catches "
msgstr "가 '진짜 의사'는 아니었다고. 하지만 "

#: deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df:229
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df"
msgid "self."
msgstr "는 말을 삼킨다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df:230
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df"
msgid " long career in healthcare."
msgstr " 의료계에서의 오랜 경력에 대해."

#: deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df:231
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df"
msgid " says that "
msgstr "는 말한다. "

#: deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df:231
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df"
msgid " never had a degree, but learned a lot 'on the streets'."
msgstr "는 학위는 없지만 '길거리에서' 많이 배웠다고."

#: deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df:232
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df"
msgid ""
" twirls a scalpel around like an expert, but then drops it into a storm "
"drain."
msgstr "는 전문가처럼 메스를 빙글빙글 돌리다 빗물 배수구에 떨어뜨린다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df:238
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df"
msgid " discusses car repair, but its hard to tell if "
msgstr "는 차 수리 얘기를 하지만, "

#: deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df:238
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df"
msgid "'s bluffing or not."
msgstr "가 허세를 부리는 건지 알기 어렵다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df:239
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df"
msgid " talks about how "
msgstr "는 이야기한다. "

#: deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df:239
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df"
msgid " used to own a repair shop."
msgstr "는 정비소를 운영했었다고."

#: deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df:240
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df"
msgid " says "
msgstr "는 말한다. "

#: deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df:240
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df"
msgid " used to be an engineer, but is evasive about what kind."
msgstr "는 엔지니어였다고. 무슨 엔지니어인지는 얼버무린다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df:241
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df"
msgid " drones on about "
msgstr "는 늘어놓는다: "

#: deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df:241
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df"
msgid " lifelong passion for cars."
msgstr " 평생에 걸친 자동차 사랑을."

#: deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df:242
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df"
msgid " promises that if something breaks, "
msgstr "는 약속한다. 뭐가 고장 나면, "

#: deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df:242
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df"
msgid " can fix it!"
msgstr "가 고칠 수 있다고!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df:243
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df"
msgid " smells like car oil, but maybe that's just poor hygiene."
msgstr "에게서 엔진오일 냄새가 나지만, 그냥 안 씻어서일지도 모른다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df:252
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df"
msgid "Strong Stranger"
msgstr "힘센 낯선 이"

#: deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df:255
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df"
msgid " claims to be really strong. "
msgstr "은(는) 힘이 정말 세다고 주장한다. "

#: deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df:273
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df"
msgid "Recruitment of the Fittest"
msgstr "적자 영입"

#: deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df:276
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df"
msgid " claims to be physically fit. "
msgstr "은(는) 체력이 좋다고 주장한다. "

#: deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df:293
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df"
msgid "A New Gun in Town"
msgstr "마을의 새 총잡이"

#: deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df:296
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df"
msgid " claims to be a great shot with a gun. "
msgstr "은(는) 총을 정말 잘 쏜다고 주장한다. "

#: deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df:314
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df"
msgid "Medical Assistance"
msgstr "의료 지원"

#: deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df:317
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df"
msgid " claims to be experienced in medical matters. "
msgstr "은(는) 의료 경험이 많다고 주장한다. "

#: deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df:335
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df"
msgid "Mechanic Service"
msgstr "정비 서비스"

#: deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df:338
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df"
msgid " claims to be great at fixing cars and machinery. "
msgstr "은(는) 차와 기계를 잘 고친다고 주장한다. "

#: deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df:357
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df"
msgid ""
"There wasn't enough food to spare for the dog.\r\n"
"\t\tIt runs away when approached."
msgstr ""
"개에게 내줄 식량이 부족했다.\r\n"
"\t\t다가가자 달아나 버린다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df:360
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df"
msgid " lures "
msgstr "은(는) 식량으로 "

#: deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df:360
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df"
msgid " over with food. "
msgstr "을(를) 꾀어낸다. "

#: deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df:360
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df"
msgid " knows a good source of meals when "
msgstr "는 좋은 밥줄을 보면 알아본다. "

#: deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df:360
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df"
msgid " sees it, and decides to stick around. "
msgstr "는 곁에 머물기로 한다. "

#: deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df:363
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df"
msgid "The group is full. Who would you like to replace to make room for "
msgstr "일행이 꽉 찼다. 누구를 빼고 자리를 만들까: "

#: deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df:365
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df"
msgid " behind"
msgstr "을(를) 두고 간다"

#: deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df:371
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df"
msgid "Dog Recruitment"
msgstr "개 영입"

#: deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df:374
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df"
msgid ""
"There is a dog wandering nearby. It's keeping its distance, but watching "
msgstr "근처에 개 한 마리가 돌아다닌다. 거리를 두고 있지만, "

#: deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df:374
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df"
msgid ""
" with guarded interest.\r\n"
"\tIt's become rare to see a dog that trusts people."
msgstr ""
"을(를) 경계하며 흥미롭게 지켜본다.\r\n"
"\t사람을 믿는 개는 이제 보기 드물다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df:376
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df"
msgid "Recruit dog - 2 food"
msgstr "개 영입 - 식량 2"

#: deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df:377
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df"
msgid "Leave the dog alone"
msgstr "개를 내버려 둔다"

#: deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df:381
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df"
msgid "Dog Magnet!"
msgstr "개 자석!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df:385
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df"
msgid ""
" is a lightning rod, but for dogs!\r\n"
"\tA dog approaches "
msgstr "은(는) 피뢰침이다. 개 전용!\r\n\t난데없이 개 한 마리가 "

#: deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df:386
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/cyoa-k-recruit.df"
msgid " out of nowhere. It seems eager to join up!"
msgstr "에게 다가온다. 합류하고 싶어 안달 난 것 같다!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/familiar-recruit.df:28
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/familiar-recruit.df"
msgid " hasn't seen "
msgstr "는 아직 "

#: deathforth/events/trade/familiar-recruit.df:28
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/familiar-recruit.df"
msgid " yet, and is real busy picking "
msgstr "을(를) 못 봤다. 지금 한창 "

#: deathforth/events/trade/familiar-recruit.df:28
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/familiar-recruit.df"
msgid " nose."
msgstr " 코를 파는 중이다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/familiar-recruit.df:29
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/familiar-recruit.df"
msgid " is sleeping on a picnic table, right out in the open."
msgstr "는 탁 트인 곳의 피크닉 테이블 위에서 자고 있다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/familiar-recruit.df:30
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/familiar-recruit.df"
msgid " was found trying to pull open a door that said PUSH on it."
msgstr "는 '미시오'라고 적힌 문을 당기려다 발견됐다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/familiar-recruit.df:31
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/familiar-recruit.df"
msgid " is humming a little song, and hasn't noticed "
msgstr "는 작게 노래를 흥얼거리느라, 아직 "

#: deathforth/events/trade/familiar-recruit.df:31
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/familiar-recruit.df"
msgid " yet."
msgstr "을(를) 알아채지 못했다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/familiar-recruit.df:32
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/familiar-recruit.df"
msgid " is being thrown out by "
msgstr "는 "

#: deathforth/events/trade/familiar-recruit.df:32
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/familiar-recruit.df"
msgid " former group. They seem pretty angry. "
msgstr " 이전 일행에게서 쫓겨나는 중이다. 꽤 화난 것 같다. "

#: deathforth/events/trade/familiar-recruit.df:32
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/familiar-recruit.df"
msgid " shrugs."
msgstr "은(는) 어깨를 으쓱한다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/familiar-recruit.df:33
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/familiar-recruit.df"
msgid " was sleeping in an abandoned house. "
msgstr "는 버려진 집에서 자고 있었다. "

#: deathforth/events/trade/familiar-recruit.df:33
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/familiar-recruit.df"
msgid " is slightly irritated to have been woken up."
msgstr "는 잠이 깨서 살짝 짜증이 났다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/familiar-recruit.df:34
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/familiar-recruit.df"
msgid " is sitting in a park, reading a book."
msgstr "는 공원에 앉아 책을 읽고 있다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/familiar-recruit.df:35
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/familiar-recruit.df"
msgid ""
" was making tons of noise, playing a portable game console at full blast."
msgstr "는 휴대용 게임기를 최대 볼륨으로 하며 엄청 시끄럽게 굴고 있었다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/familiar-recruit.df:36
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/familiar-recruit.df"
msgid " is eating a candy bar. Those things still haven't gone bad."
msgstr "는 초코바를 먹고 있다. 그건 아직도 상하지 않았다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/familiar-recruit.df:37
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/familiar-recruit.df"
msgid " stretches. Then "
msgstr "는 스트레칭을 한다. 그러고는 "

#: deathforth/events/trade/familiar-recruit.df:37
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/familiar-recruit.df"
msgid " stretches some more. It's an elaborate stretching routine."
msgstr "는 스트레칭을 더 한다. 정교한 스트레칭 루틴이다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/familiar-recruit.df:38
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/familiar-recruit.df"
msgid " pokes the dirt with a stick. Maybe "
msgstr "는 막대기로 흙을 쑤신다. 어쩌면 "

#: deathforth/events/trade/familiar-recruit.df:38
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/familiar-recruit.df"
msgid " is drawing plans, maybe just poking the dirt with a stick."
msgstr "는 계획을 그리는 중일지도, 그냥 막대기로 흙을 쑤시는 중일지도."

#: deathforth/events/trade/familiar-recruit.df:39
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/familiar-recruit.df"
msgid " is staring at a map, with an expression of total confusion."
msgstr "는 완전히 혼란스러운 표정으로 지도를 노려보고 있다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/familiar-recruit.df:40
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/familiar-recruit.df"
msgid " is yelling at some survivors, because they made fun of "
msgstr "는 생존자 몇에게 소리치고 있다. 그들이 "

#: deathforth/events/trade/familiar-recruit.df:40
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/familiar-recruit.df"
msgid " hair."
msgstr " 머리를 놀렸기 때문이다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/familiar-recruit.df:41
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/familiar-recruit.df"
msgid " is kicking a car in frustration. The car is emitting plumes of smoke."
msgstr "는 화가 나서 차를 걷어차고 있다. 차에서 연기가 뭉게뭉게 피어오른다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/familiar-recruit.df:42
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/familiar-recruit.df"
msgid ""
" is fighting a single zombie, then suddenly trips and falls down in an "
"awkward mistake. "
msgstr "는 좀비 하나와 싸우다 어이없는 실수로 갑자기 넘어진다. "

#: deathforth/events/trade/familiar-recruit.df:42
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/familiar-recruit.df"
msgid " gets really embarassed when "
msgstr "는 무척 민망해한다. 그러다 "

#: deathforth/events/trade/familiar-recruit.df:42
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/familiar-recruit.df"
msgid " notices "
msgstr "는 알아챈다: "

#: deathforth/events/trade/familiar-recruit.df:55
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/familiar-recruit.df"
msgid "Sweet Ride"
msgstr "멋진 차"

#: deathforth/events/trade/familiar-recruit.df:56
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/familiar-recruit.df"
msgid " said that "
msgstr "은(는) 말한다. "

#: deathforth/events/trade/familiar-recruit.df:56
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/familiar-recruit.df"
msgid " had "
msgstr "는 근처에 "

#: deathforth/events/trade/familiar-recruit.df:56
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/familiar-recruit.df"
msgid " own car stashed nearby, and that it's a "
msgstr " 차를 숨겨 뒀는데, 그게 "

#: deathforth/events/trade/familiar-recruit.df:56
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/familiar-recruit.df"
msgid "'pretty sweet ride'"
msgstr "'꽤 멋진 차'라고."

#: deathforth/events/trade/familiar-recruit.df:56
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/familiar-recruit.df"
msgid ""
"\r\n"
"\t\tWould you like to switch to "
msgstr ""
"\r\n"
"\t\t차를 바꿀까: "

#: deathforth/events/trade/familiar-recruit.df:57
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/familiar-recruit.df"
msgid "'s car?"
msgstr "의 차로?"

#: deathforth/events/trade/familiar-recruit.df:58
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/familiar-recruit.df"
msgid "Keep current car"
msgstr "지금 차를 유지한다"

#: deathforth/events/trade/familiar-recruit.df:59
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/familiar-recruit.df"
msgid "Switch to new car"
msgstr "새 차로 바꾼다"

#: deathforth/events/trade/familiar-recruit.df:75
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/familiar-recruit.df"
msgid " gets booted out of the group to make room for "
msgstr "은(는) 일행에서 쫓겨난다. 대신 들어오는 사람: "

#: deathforth/events/trade/familiar-recruit.df:83
#: deathforth/events/trade/familiar-recruit.df:111
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/familiar-recruit.df"
msgid "Leave "
msgstr "일단 "

#: deathforth/events/trade/familiar-recruit.df:83
#: deathforth/events/trade/familiar-recruit.df:111
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/familiar-recruit.df"
msgid " behind"
msgstr "을(를) 두고 간다"

#: deathforth/events/trade/familiar-recruit.df:88
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/familiar-recruit.df"
msgid ""
"The group is full.\r\n"
"\t\tWho would you like to replace to make room for "
msgstr ""
"일행이 꽉 찼다.\r\n"
"\t\t누구를 빼고 자리를 만들까: "

#: deathforth/events/trade/familiar-recruit.df:93
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/familiar-recruit.df"
msgid " accepts "
msgstr "은(는) "

#: deathforth/events/trade/familiar-recruit.df:93
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/familiar-recruit.df"
msgid " to the team!"
msgstr "을(를) 팀으로 받아들인다!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/familiar-recruit.df:101
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/familiar-recruit.df"
msgid "Familiar Faces"
msgstr "낯익은 얼굴들"

#: deathforth/events/trade/familiar-recruit.df:103
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/familiar-recruit.df"
msgid "NO MORE PEOPLE!"
msgstr "더 이상 사람 없음!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/familiar-recruit.df:107
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/familiar-recruit.df"
msgid "Whoa, it's "
msgstr "와, "

#: deathforth/events/trade/familiar-recruit.df:107
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/familiar-recruit.df"
msgid "! It's nice to see a familiar face! "
msgstr "(이)잖아! 낯익은 얼굴을 보니 반갑다! "

#: deathforth/events/trade/familiar-recruit.df:108
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/familiar-recruit.df"
msgid "TRAIT: "
msgstr "특성: "

#: deathforth/events/trade/familiar-recruit.df:109
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/familiar-recruit.df"
msgid "  PERK: "
msgstr "  특전: "

#: deathforth/events/trade/familiar-recruit.df:110
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/familiar-recruit.df"
msgid "Recruit "
msgstr "영입: "

#: deathforth/events/trade/familiar-recruit.df:110
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/familiar-recruit.df"
msgid " to team"
msgstr "<EMPTY>"

#: deathforth/events/trade/gnomey.df:12
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/gnomey.df"
msgid "Nice purchase, NERD!"
msgstr "좋은 구매야, 찐따!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/gnomey.df:13
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/gnomey.df"
msgid "OOOooooooo!"
msgstr "오오오오오오오!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/gnomey.df:14
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/gnomey.df"
msgid "Keep on looting toilets! "
msgstr "화장실 계속 털라고! "

#: deathforth/events/trade/gnomey.df:15
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/gnomey.df"
msgid "Ooo! Oooooooo!"
msgstr "오! 오오오오오!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/gnomey.df:16
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/gnomey.df"
msgid "Good luck with Canada! "
