msgstr "는 강도 높은 운동으로 땀을 흘린다!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:209
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid " fitness, but it was FREE!"
msgstr " 체력이 오르진 않았지만, 공짜였다!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:220
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
