#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:238
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid "Who wants strenuous exercise for the sake of fitness?"
msgstr "체력을 위해 힘든 운동을 할 사람?"

