msgid " to the fitness instructor."
msgstr " - 피트니스 강사에게."

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:249
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid ""
"That's what I like to hear! You're ready for the MIRACLE FITNESS ROUTINE!"
msgstr "바로 그거야! 넌 기적의 피트니스 루틴을 받을 준비가 됐어!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:249
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid ""
"\r\n"
"\t\tIt's likely that she just heard "
