"의 말을 잘못 들은 것 같다. 놀랍고 최첨단인 맨몸 운동이 이어진다.\r\n"
"\t\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:251
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid " -> FITNESS SKILL MAXED OUT!"
msgstr " -> 체력 최대치!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:253
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid "Her reaction is mostly disappointment."
msgstr "그녀는 대체로 실망한 반응이다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:253
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid ""
"\r\n"
"\t\tYeah, well, have fun getting eaten by zombies."
msgstr ""
"\r\n"
"\t\t그래, 뭐, 좀비한테 잘 먹혀 봐."

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:254
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid ""
"\r\n"
"\t\tShe jogs backwards until she's out of sight. Then she's gone."
msgstr ""
"\r\n"
"\t\t그녀는 시야에서 사라질 때까지 뒤로 조깅해 간다. 그리고 사라진다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:260
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid "Fitness Instructor"
msgstr "피트니스 강사"

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:261
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid ""
" finds a woman decked out in sweat bands, limb warmers, and exercise clothes. All bright neon.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 땀 밴드, 팔다리 워머, 운동복으로 쫙 빼입은 여자를 발견한다. 전부 형광색이다.\r\n"
"\t"

