#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:262
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid ""
"\r\n"
"\tShe's been continuously running in place this whole time."
msgstr ""
"\r\n"
"\t그녀는 이 내내 제자리 뛰기를 하고 있다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df:285
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/oldtrade.df"
msgid " gets FREE medical training!"
msgstr "은(는) 의료 훈련을 공짜로 받는다!"
